        Tokyo is eyeing Indian firing ranges to test its 1,000-km class long-range missiles and drone swarms. How this Indo-Japanese defense pivot alters the regional balance.
        
        [SPLIT]
        ⚡ Geographical and airspace limitations in densely populated Japan necessitate overseas testing grounds for extended-range munitions.
